From: OTB <otb@local>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: add guarded MT7988 HW LRO

Add the MT7988 HW-LRO rings alongside RSS, keep normal/RSS page pools, use
the NETSYS v3 register layout and IRQ routing, and rebuild a deduplicated
global destination-IP table. Exact TCP/IPv4 destination rules remain usable
below a bond or bridge while unmatched and forwarded traffic stays on RSS.
With no classifier rule installed, aggregation remains inactive.

